   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Solid bars are 250 ms source calls from the source-call log of one run. Ghost bars: the same two calls from blocking resolvers on one event loop.",
